# Trivy ignore list for the mochi-world Docker image.
#
# Add a CVE id (one per line) to suppress findings that are accepted —
# typically because the fix is upstream-blocked and we're waiting on a
# distribution to ship it. Each entry should carry a comment explaining
# why and a date to re-evaluate.
#
# Empty on purpose. The image is distroless/static-debian12, which carries no
# libc, no shell and no package manager, so it has none of the base-image
# findings core's cc-debian12 image accumulates — core's glibc suppression has
# no analogue here. Anything that does appear is ours and should be fixed
# rather than listed.
